  "id": "group-factors",
  "term": "group factors",
  "definition": "Group factors are characteristics of a group, such as how many individuals are in it, that can shape how the group moves and responds under stressful conditions. In this source, these factors interact with environmental conditions to affect flow, congestion, and evacuation efficiency.",
